# MODEL-G-031: Children: paint + point label, label only, empty, flabels; parent use boxes (Q-MODEL-6, Q-MODEL-19).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/mt -noprompt
snap internal
load c1
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
box 15 15 15 15
label p
save c1
load c2
box 3 4 3 4
label q
save c2
load c3
save c3
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell c1
box 100 0 100 0
getcell c2
box 200 0 200 0
getcell c3
box 300 0 300 0
getcell input/fl
save top
